@* ===== The rest of the homepage content lives in the database (Pages table, slug = "home").
   Announcement bar, navbar, and footer are NO LONGER part of static stored content — they always
   render from Views/Shared/_AnnouncementBar.cshtml, Views/Shared/_SiteNavBar.cshtml, and Views/Shared/_SiteFooter.cshtml,
   so editing them in Admin updates every single page across the site. ===== *@
